Subject: [PATCH 16/32] Record protected DEX UI recovery evidence

Targeted Manager-driven UI capture now has reproducible evidence for logical DEX recovery and CodeItem backfill, including the explicit artifact-limit boundary.

Constraint: Preserve conservative reconstruction and document device evidence without claiming unlimited coverage.
Rejected: Treating 500 backfilled CodeItems as full UI coverage | 512-artifact and active-entry limits remain observable.
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
Directive: Keep future experiments Manager-published and report partial reasons verbatim.
Tested: unzip -t on 1549 entries; ZIP SHA-256 verification; Manager publish/launch smoke on f5e3adbc.
Not-tested: Full Framework test suite remains blocked by its pre-existing API signature drift.
